      "title": {
        "en": "Helpful and knowledgeable shop staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Shoppers consistently praise store assistants such as Sophie, Jamie, Andy, and Levi for their friendliness, patience, and helpful guidance. Reviewers appreciate that staff spend time answering questions regarding animal care, specialized pet diets, and aquarium setups. Customers highlight that employees provide sound advice without rushing."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 12,
      "title": {
        "en": "Extensive stock and aquarium department"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Visitors frequently commend the store broad selection of companion supplies, pet food, and accessories. Reviewers particularly highlight the large aquatics department at the rear of the shop, noting clean, spacious setups for betta fish and healthy aquatic plants. Shoppers value having a comprehensive range of items under one roof."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Care for fish and small pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Customers highlight the good health and proper housing of small pets including hamsters, gerbils, rats, and tropical fish. Reviewers note that assistants check animals carefully before sending them home and explain proper feeding and care routines. Pet owners appreciate the thoughtful attention paid to animal welfare in the store."
      }
    }
  ],
